{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>謝安琪近期與 Ivy So合唱充滿古典詩意新歌《葬花辭》引爆全網熱烈討論，大批資深網民隨即翻出她早於12年前拍 …</p><p></p>\n<p>謝安琪近期與 Ivy So合唱充滿古典詩意新歌《葬花辭》引爆全網熱烈討論，大批資深網民隨即翻出她早於12年前拍攝一輯極度罕見「人妻旗袍床照」作回顧，這輯來自免費雜誌的絕版靚相，展現當年37歲謝安琪極致誘惑嘅模樣！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17956847084312953_21312662706b07f964e5bde.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"895794322_10166176825710555_202944755977262784_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17956847084312953_21312662706b07f964e5bde.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>一買要買兩本！封面與的封底合拼，才能展現橫躺羅漢床的誘人甫士！（圖片來源：HMVISS）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>謝安琪絕密旗袍床照誘惑全網</h2>\n<p>當年已為人妻兼育有一子謝安琪為雜誌拍攝封面及內頁寫真，換上粉白底色配以大紅牡丹花紋貼身改良旗袍。相片中她穿上紅色高跟鞋斜臥在床榻及中式貴妃椅上，高衩剪裁完美展現修長美腿與玲瓏浮凸曲線。配以復古紅唇與迷離眼神，將東方女性嫵媚與獨有成熟韻味發揮至極致。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17956847117689716_1217399266b07f96847dfe.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"bkn-20231005000041409-1005_00862_001_05p.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17956847117689716_1217399266b07f96847dfe.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>仲有裸足半穿紅鞋Close UP （圖片來源：HMVISS）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568471330621593_10886968336b07f969a5429.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"468911053_10160252867752680_8498390164223861619_n (1).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568471330621593_10886968336b07f969a5429.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HMVISS）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568471422627385_16061685686b07f96aa26bf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"468871134_10160252867747680_3084167775371190416_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568471422627385_16061685686b07f96aa26bf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HMVISS）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>絕版雜誌記載謝安琪性感身姿令人想入非非</h2>\n<p>這輯惹火相片源自2014年10月出版免費雜誌，除了橫躺羅漢床全版跨頁封面及封底，內頁更有對鏡化妝等多個造型。目前該期雜誌已經完全絕版，市面上極少流通，近年在網上拍賣平台更被炒賣至高達80元不等。這批珍貴影像不僅紀錄了當時狀態巔峰時刻，更成為眾多粉絲爭相收藏珍品。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568471505357581_12455910876b07f96b9b7b7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"468934323_10160252867757680_7817847010226097797_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568471505357581_12455910876b07f96b9b7b7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HMVISS）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568471635977142_5719769506b07f96cbcf4a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"O0xipUw.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568471635977142_5719769506b07f96cbcf4a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HMVISS）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568471726222890_9265249506b07f96dc4ec7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"468861006_10160252867732680_1163494715371682667_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568471726222890_9265249506b07f96dc4ec7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HMVISS）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>兩年後懷第二胎 產後復出簽約麥浚龍成功瘦身</h2>\n<p>拍攝這輯寫真兩年後，謝安琪宣布懷上第二胎，至2017年產女初期因專注照顧家庭及餵哺母乳，身形與臉龐一度較為圓潤。女兒斷奶後她隨即簽約麥浚龍旗下準備復出，並開始嚴格執行自然瘦身計劃。透過每週三次舉重訓練、跑步、行山及瑜伽，她在約一年內成功減去30磅，體重回落至懷孕前100磅左右，更曾罕有晒出腹肌與馬甲線照片。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568471818363031_12830114916b07f96f0321b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"903699054_10166176826255555_8515503030074503044_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568471818363031_12830114916b07f96f0321b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HMVISS）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/%e8%ac%9d%e5%ae%89%e7%90%aa-%e8%98%87%e9%9b%85%e7%90%b3-%e8%91%ac%e8%8a%b1%e8%be%ad-3550066/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">謝安琪 IvySo 破天荒合唱《葬花辭》 12年前絕密旗袍床照意外出土 兩代女神魅力對決：完全唔輸蝕</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/%e8%98%87%e9%9b%85%e7%90%b3-%e8%91%ac%e8%8a%b1%e8%be%ad-%e8%ac%9d%e5%ae%89%e7%90%aa-3550212/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Ivy So現身商台「貼身戰衣」洗版 完美曲線中正流量密碼 網民熱議平價同款</a></p>\n<h2>網民激讚新歌《葬花辭》與舊照</h2>\n<p>隨著這組相隔12年「出土」舊照與與Ivy So合唱的新歌《葬花辭》古典風格互相輝映，各大討論區隨即引發熱烈討論。不少人留言大讚當年狀態勇猛：「當年呢輯旗袍床照真係風華絕代，完全係天花板級數！」更有大批忠實歌迷表示當年造型毫不輸蝕：「12年前謝安琪真係一啲都唔輸蝕，甚至多咗份女人味」。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568471505357581_12455910876b07f96b9b7b7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"468934323_10160252867757680_7817847010226097797_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568471505357581_12455910876b07f96b9b7b7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HMVISS）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%97%97%e8%a2%8d%e5%af%ab%e7%9c%9f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">旗袍寫真</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%91%ac%e8%8a%b1%e8%be%ad/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">葬花辭</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%ac%9d%e5%ae%89%e7%90%aa/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">謝安琪</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3550573\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 28 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T03:44:13.669383+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1366,"images":9,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T01:30:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T04:17:30.095720+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T03:37:38.176207+00:00","content_hash":"421eba9e6fb02412fcf80c18a8690f5093b47872c4fe21c412734c5308fa1f42","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}